### Create incident
POST http://localhost:8080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Car accident claim",
  "type": "AUTO",
  "severity": 4,
  "status": "OPEN",
  "date": "2026-01-16",
  "description": "Rear-end collision reported"
}

